  sig=untyped string
  doc=SlotCody is the Cody coding AGENT (matrix/cody): the orchestrator/\nworker coding engine served by codyd beside Neo. Cody never borrows\nanother agent's slot — both roles (orchestrator planning/adjudication\nand worker implementation) meter here under Cody's own identity. It is\nNOT value-moving: codyd holds no signing key and never routes through\nMCL. Reuses already-priced models — no rateTable row, no version bump.
EDGES
  ^references=matrix/gateway/internal/routing.validSlot
  ^defines=matrix/gateway/internal/types/types.go

